         would collide under the notification action slot's truncation with "Save last N min"
         once both start with "Save"/"Salvar", risking a wrong tap that either loses the moment
         or starts an hours long recording (issue #55). Kept a distinct verb, "Record" instead of
         "Save", short enough to stay legible at the slot's real width. -->
